{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2022-10-24 10:10:00', 'title': "THERMO KING JOINS ROAD READY'S LOGIQ SMART PARTNER NETWORK", 'text': "SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ROAD READY, THE LEADER IN ADVANCED TELEMATICS AND SMART FLEET SOLUTIONS FROM CLARIENCE TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THERMO KING IS JOINING ITS LOGIQ SMART PARTNER NETWORK, EXPANDING THE BRAND'S CONNECTIVITY SOLUTIONS TO NOW INCLUDE COLD CHAIN TECHNOLOGY."}{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2022-10-24 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRANE TECHNOLOGIES TO DEBUT AND FEATURE EMPLOYEE-POWERED SOCIAL INNOVATION AND DECARBONIZATION SOLUTIONS AT VERGE22', 'text': 'SWORDS, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TRANE TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: TT), A GLOBAL CLIMATE INNOVATOR, WILL BE AT VERGE22 TO DEBUT A NET-ZERO COOLING CART DESIGNED TO PROVIDE SUSTAINABLE AND AFFORDABLE COOLING FOR STREET VENDORS, WHILE COMBATING FOOD LOSS, REDUCING EMISSIONS AND IMPROVING THEIR LIVELIHOODS.'}